> </span><span style=\"color: white;\">Support forum provide\nfor over 24h, every day.</span>[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1451149883930{margin-bottom: 50px !important;padding-top: 10px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;background-color: #f9f9f9 !important;}\"][vc_column][vc_custom_heading text=\"<strong>FaQs. General Information</strong>\" font_container=\"tag:h1|font_size:38|text_align:left|line_height:1\" use_theme_fonts=\"yes\" css=\".vc_custom_1484182012150{margin-bottom: 35px !important;}\"][vc_row_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\n<h5><strong>Eu dictumst cum at sed euismod condimentum?</strong></h5>\nJusto est cum sit fames ac convallis est non leo rhoncus feugiat scelerisque tempus nec sapien vestibulum dis parturient felis a taciti.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n<h5><strong>Odio molestie hac eros consectetur scelerisque?</strong></h5>\nEu tincidunt magnis erat malesuada vulputate parturient nisl a nisl in a facilisis porttitor ullamcorper nec a a lectus eget non leo ad ad parturient pretium magna.A ligula dis vestibulum dapibus.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][vc_column_inner width=\"1/2\"][vc_column_text]\n<h5><strong>Vestibulum ullamcorper auctor ornare iaculis?</strong></h5>\nFacilisi malesuada in penatibus a torquent at a parturient suspendisse suspendisse per a augue fames commodo ullamcorper duis.[/vc_column_text][vc_column_text]\n<h5><strong>Elit id blandit bibendum velit non vulputate?</strong></h5>\nParturient lectus malesuada condimentum suspendisse urna a dis convallis adipiscing vestibulum elit amet porta quis parturient a id facilisis arcu eleifend.A purus nulla suspendisse ullamcorper orci fames.[/vc_column_text][/vc_column_inner][/vc_row_inner][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row css=\".vc_custom_1451149853822{margin-top: 30px !important;margin-bottom: 30px !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"7/12\" css=\".vc_custom_1434813322976{padding-right: 50px !important;}\"][vc_tta_tabs color=\"white\" active_section=\"1\" no_fill_content_area=\"true\"][vc_tta_section title=\"Sale\" tab_id=\"Sale-FAQ\"][vc_toggle title=\"I haven\'t received my item. What can I do? \" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" open=\"true\" el_id=\"1484155474955-a93fa59b-0c2f\"]Sed primis eu conubia erat ut nam vitae a habitant dui adipiscing a dignissim eu a ad venenatis. Non vivamus enim himenaeos porta id morbi montes ut sem scelerisque in litora id scelerisque consectetur eget cras hac nascetur sociis in feugiat mi platea odio pretium ullamcorper.\n\nNon vivamus enim himenaeos porta id morbi montes ut sem scelerisque in litora id scelerisque consectetur eget cras hac nascetur sociis in feugiat mi platea odio pretium ullamcorper.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"Ipsum ac erat cursus rutrum parturient a a nostra?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" el_id=\"1484155474989-c0e992b2-78cc\"]Sed primis eu conubia erat ut nam vitae a habitant dui adipiscing a dignissim eu a ad venenatis. Non vivamus enim himenaeos porta id morbi montes ut sem scelerisque in litora id scelerisque consectetur eget cras hac nascetur sociis in feugiat mi platea odio pretium ullamcorper.\n\nNon vivamus enim himenaeos porta id morbi montes ut sem scelerisque in litora id scelerisque consectetur eget cras hac nascetur sociis in feugiat mi platea odio pretium ullamcorper.[/vc_toggle][vc_toggle title=\"Tellus ridiculus non tempus laoreet nec diam eleifend id ullamcorper?\" style=\"arrow\" color=\"grey\" el_id=\"1484155475047-b52af13d-7bb0\"]Sed primis eu conubia erat ut nam vitae a habitant dui adipiscing a dignissim eu a ad venenatis. Non vivamus enim himenaeos porta id morbi montes ut sem scelerisque in litora id scelerisque consectetur eget cras hac nascetur sociis in feugiat mi platea odio pretium ullamcorper.\n\nNon vivamus enim himenaeos porta id morbi montes ut sem scelerisque in litora id scelerisque consectetur eget cras hac nascetur sociis in feugiat 