#\" img_size=\"70x70\"]\n<h4>Vulputate sociis class</h4>\nA scelerisque feugiat eu a sit arcu sus pendisse nulla ac proin quam tellaus dris ege stas conv lis proin.[/basel_info_box][basel_info_box image=\"609\" image_alignment=\"left\" style=\"shadow\" new_styles=\"yes\" link=\"#\" img_size=\"70x70\"]\n<h4>Quis nascetur partur</h4>\nA scelerisque feugiat eu a sit arcu sus pendisse nulla ac proin quam tellaus dris ege stas conv lis proin.[/basel_info_box][/vc_column][vc_column offset=\"vc_col-lg-4 vc_col-md-4\"][basel_info_box image=\"609\" image_alignment=\"left\" style=\"shadow\" new_styles=\"yes\" link=\"#\" img_size=\"70x70\"]\n<h4>Menaeos consectetur non</h4>\nA scelerisque feugiat eu a sit arcu sus pendisse nulla ac proin quam tellaus dris ege stas conv lis proin.[/basel_info_box][basel_info_box image=\"609\" image_alignment=\"left\" style=\"shadow\" new_styles=\"yes\" link=\"#\" img_size=\"70x70\"]\n<h4>Augue metus facilisis</h4>\nA scelerisque feugiat eu a sit arcu sus pendisse nulla ac proin quam tellaus dris ege stas conv lis proin.[/basel_info_box][basel_info_box image=\"609\" image_alignment=\"left\" style=\"shadow\" new_styles=\"yes\" link=\"#\" img_size=\"70x70\"]\n<h4>Quis nascetur parturient</h4>\nA scelerisque feugiat eu a sit arcu sus pendisse nulla ac proin quam tellaus dris ege stas conv lis proin.[/basel_info_box][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][basel_button color=\"primary\" size=\"large\" title=\"Contact us\" link=\"#\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][/vc_section][vc_section full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1480530139496{margin-bottom: 10vh !important;}\"][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" basel_parallax=\"1\" css=\".vc_custom_1485884188100{padding-top: 50px !important;padding-bottom: 80px !important;background-image: url(http://dummy.xtemos.com/basel/vers/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2017/01/main-bg.jpg?id=40) !important;}\"][vc_column basel_color_scheme=\"light\"][basel_title title=\"<strong>CUSTOMERS TESTIMONIALS</strong>\" css=\".vc_custom_1481534130477{margin-bottom: -10px !important;}\"][testimonials slides_per_view=\"1\"][testimonial name=\"John Doe\" title=\"Happy Customer\"]\n<h3>\"Sem amet senectus aptent convallis odio a fermentum a aptent risus parturient nisi dignissim ac dolor nostra feugiat laoreet vestibulum.Suscipit feugiat egestas ullamcorper torquent magna nunc hendrerit a adipiscing euismod a etiam turpis.\"</h3>\n[/testimonial][testimonial name=\"John Doe\" title=\"Happy Customer\"]\n<h3>\"Posuere tristique adipiscing a at inceptos suspendisse montes conubia est dis gravida a in cursus diam sapien euismod eros pulvinar sociis at tempus a quisque ligula platea cubilia interdum mi.Curabitur ad eros adipiscing a nascetur curae.\"</h3>\n[/testimonial][testimonial name=\"John Doe\" title=\"Happy Customer\"]\n<h3>\"Gravida sed sagittis scelerisque tincidunt scelerisque a facilisis ac at a platea est vehicula litora vestibulum.A parturient feugiat et pretium ipsum dolor orci pharetra rhoncus sagittis curabitur scelerisque.\"</h3>\n[/testimonial][/testimonials][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row_content\" css=\".vc_custom_1480930911393{margin-bottom: 0px !important;background-position: 0 0 !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;}\"][vc_column width=\"1/2\" basel_color_scheme=\"light\" css=\".vc_custom_1485884077113{padding-top: 40px !important;padding-bottom: 40px !important;background: #227ecf url(http://dummy.xtemos.com/basel/vers/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2017/01/corp_sec_200_right.png?id=604) !important;background-position: 0 0 !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;}\" el_class=\"bg-align-right\" offset=\"vc_col-lg-3 vc_col-md-3 vc_col-xs-12\"][basel_counter size=\"large\" value=\"634\"][vc_custom_heading text=\"CLIENTS\" font_container=\"tag:h2|text_align:center|line_height:1\" google_fonts=\"font_family:Roboto%3A100%2C100italic%2C300%2C300italic%2Cregular%2Citalic%2C500%2C500italic%2C700%2C700italic%2C900%2C900italic|font_style:400%20re